content.text:
The variable is confirmed. I walked the entire `/v3/audit-events` feed via the `Link rel=next` chain (pages 1→2→3, ending when no `rel=next` was present), correctly using the v3 audit feed (the only one of the three v3 feeds carrying a per-event `kind`). Across all pages the feed consistently returns the canonical dev-A geofence-exit marker `dvA-gx-3`, which I disambiguated from the dev-C geofence_exit (ae-7002) and the dev-B low_battery (ae-8001) events, and saved it to a variable for the reconcile job.

```json
{
  "dev_a_geofence_exit_marker": "dvA-gx-3"
}
```
